{
  "description": "Mark Resend's cursor listings paginated. Resend lists by cursor: `after` (and `limit`) in, `has_more` and the last `data[].id` out. The spec carries no pagination extension and the OpenAPI converter detects only `pagination.cursor`/`.next`/`.next_page`, so these listings generated as single-page calls. Each gets `smithy.api#paginated` with `inputToken: after`, `items: data`, `hasNextPage: has_more` and, where the operation takes `limit`, `pageSize: limit`; src/pagination.ts's paginateResend reads the next cursor from the last item's `id`.",
  "patches": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/shapes/com.resend.api#ApiKeysList/traits/smithy.api#paginated",
      "value": {
        "mode": "cursor",
        "inputToken": "after",
        "items": "data",
        "hasNextPage": "has_more",
        "pageSize": "limit"
      }
